sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant MW as Middleware + Routing + Auth
  participant CT as Controller Action
  participant SV as Service
  participant EF as DbContext (EF Core)
  participant DB as SQL Server
  participant V as Razor View
  B->>MW: HTTP request (link click or form POST)
  MW-->>B: 401 / 403 if authentication or policy fails
  MW->>CT: Endpoint matched, model binding + validation (ViewModel)
  CT->>SV: Call business method
  SV->>EF: LINQ query or SaveChanges
  EF->>DB: Parameterized SQL
  DB-->>EF: Rows
  EF-->>SV: Entities
  SV-->>CT: Result
  CT->>V: return View(viewModel)
  V-->>B: HTML response
